Subject: [PATCH 1461/1463] =?UTF-8?q?HERESY=201553=E2=80=931558:=20the=20c?=
 =?UTF-8?q?hain's=20profiles=20(pipelines=20as=20chips,=20bypass,=20the=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?canvas's=20way),=20the=20studio's=20own=20steps=20in=20the=20pa?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ge's=20words=20where=20they=20belong,=20Before=20/=20after=20on?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20every=20file=20of=20the=20tree,=20a=20step's=20picture,=20a?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20file=20field,=20a=20match=20onto=20the=20DAW's=20master?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- heresy-post.js: Profile in the chain's row (the classic chain or a pipeline the studio or a plugin brings), chips with their modes, one unchecked bypassed (kept per pipeline), Run and Run up to here send the pipeline, the canvas draws its way; built-in steps placed by their after and group, their words translated; a file field filled with the tree and the other takes
- heresy-derived.js: Before / after on every file (the studio's report step on it), a step's picture shown, the studio's own files named in the page's words, Onto the DAW's master for a match (one undo step)
- heresy-menu.js: a choice may ask to be a row (data-hc-row)
- app.js: window.ruachTakes for a step's file field
- app.css, i18n ×11

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
